  <h1 style="margin:18px 0 4px;font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-0.03em">Data and reproducibility</h1>
  <p class="muted">The site is static and has no private API. These are the public data files and the reproducibility trail.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardhead"><h2>Current files</h2></div>
    <div class="tablewrap"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>File</th><th>What it contains</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/latest.json"><code>/data/latest.json</code></a></td><td>Current average, range, series, hemicycle, weights.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/robustez.json"><code>/data/robustez.json</code></a></td><td>Robustness indicators, house contrast, weights.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/status.json"><code>/data/status.json</code></a></td><td>Build, commit, counts, sources and SHA-256 hashes.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/changelog.json"><code>/data/changelog.json</code></a></td><td>Build/data history with hashes.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/v1/latest.json"><code>/data/v1/latest.json</code></a></td><td>Versioned copy of the current aggregate.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/v1/robustez.json"><code>/data/v1/robustez.json</code></a></td><td>Versioned copy of robustness.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="/data/v1/status.json"><code>/data/v1/status.json</code></a></td><td>Versioned status/hashes copy.</td></tr>
