  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardhead"><h2>Reproduce it</h2></div>
    <p class="muted">The calculation is deterministic: D’Hondt and the weighting use no random seed. To reproduce a build you need the code, the frozen input CSV and the same parameters.</p>
    <pre style="overflow:auto;padding:12px;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:8px"><code>git clone https://github.com/mcasrom/elecciones29n-osint
cd elecciones29n-osint
bash scripts/reproduce.sh /tmp/e29n-repro</code></pre>
    <p class="muted small">The script rebuilds from the current <code>data/polls_history.csv</code> and prints SHA-256 hashes. For a historical build, freeze that CSV and the input JSON first.</p>
  </div>

